; Take a card that came in over the air.
FORM CARD_LOAD
TITLE Take a card that came in
SUMMARY Keeps a station card that arrived over the air or on a stick. Keeping it trusts nothing yet: check it by voice next.
LEVEL ZERO
ORDER 21
ACTION card_import
FIELD id Card received(@msg_cards)
FIELD file Or from a file(X) check=path
FIELD replace Replace the card held for that station(Y,N) default=N
NEXT CARD_CHECK
BEGIN_HELP
Card received:
The messages that hold a station card, newest first. For a card on a stick, give the file instead.
END

Replace the card held for that station:
Only Y when the station told you it was rebuilt. A different card for a station you already hold is refused otherwise.
END
